1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,903
The robot knows where you live. Literally.

2
00:00:02,983 --> 00:00:05,318
Not killer robots. Worse. Helpful.

3
00:00:05,398 --> 00:00:06,952
Nori rolls the hallway.

4
00:00:07,032 --> 00:00:10,929
SaschiRob runs local memory - no cloud trace by default.

5
00:00:11,009 --> 00:00:13,983
You forgot the keys. It didn't. It watched.

6
00:00:14,063 --> 00:00:16,114
The exocortex just grew hands.

7
00:00:16,194 --> 00:00:18,742
Household bots are not a new species.

8
00:00:18,822 --> 00:00:22,009
They are your outsourced memory with grippers.

9
00:00:22,089 --> 00:00:26,768
When the loop remembers better than you, inversion becomes visible.

10
00:00:26,848 --> 00:00:28,898
The robot remembers your keys.

11
00:00:28,978 --> 00:00:30,825
You remember approving it.
